## 5 Accessibility floor

Non-negotiable minimum. Colour contrast lives in `DESIGN.md` §Colors and is
verified by the WCAG-AA ritual; everything else that is not about colour is here.

- Target size and spacing floor: <value>
- Every control has an accessible name; icon-only controls carry a label
- Focus order follows reading order; no positive `tabindex`
- Motion respects `prefers-reduced-motion`; nothing conveys meaning by motion alone
- Nothing conveys meaning by colour alone
- Live regions announce what changed, once
- <floor specific to this product>

